":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてどこにも言わず自分の中にあった目標は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『自信を持ってステージに立つこと』でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌もダンスも見た目にも自信がないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが見てて伝わっちゃったらダメだと思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく耳にする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まず自信があるフリをする。そしたら本当に自信を持てるようになる」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という言葉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これをやってみたんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにはどう見えていたのでしょうか…？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はツアーを完走して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、改めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに立つことが楽しくて幸せなことなんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と実感することができました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから先も、先輩方が築き上げて下さった乃木坂46を守りたいという責任を感じました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は私なんかがこんな事言っていいのかなーと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"